* LM5113 / LM5113-Q1 half-bridge GaN driver -- BEHAVIOURAL model
* Written for the gan-buck-converter power-stage simulation. NOT a TI model.
* Every number is a 25 C typical from the TI datasheet (SNVS725I) unless marked ASSUMED.
*
* Modelled:   TTL input thresholds with hysteresis, input pull-downs, propagation delays,
*             split outputs with pull-up / pull-down resistance and peak-current saturation,
*             VDD and HB-HS undervoltage lockout, internal bootstrap diode that stops
*             charging at the 5.2 V HB-HS clamp level, operating supply currents.
* Not modelled: temperature, dv/dt immunity of the level shifter, minimum pulse width,
*             package inductance, negative-HS behaviour.
*
* Pins: VDD HB HOH HOL HS HI LI VSS LOH LOL   (WSON-10 pin order 1..10)
*
.subckt LM5113_BEHAV VDD HB HOH HOL HS HI LI VSS LOH LOL
+ Rpu=2.1 Rpd=0.6 Isrc=1.2 Isnk=5 tpdon=28n tpdoff=26.5n tmatch=0
+ Vir=2.06 Vhys=0.4 Vuvdd=3.8 Vuvhb=3.2 Vuvhys=0.2 Vclamp=5.2
+ Iddo=1.6m Ihbo=1.2m tslew=0.7n Cin=2p Cout=20p intdiode=1
* --- inputs: 200 k pull-down, Cin ASSUMED ---
Rhi HI VSS 200k
Chi HI VSS {Cin}
Rli LI VSS 200k
Cli LI VSS {Cin}
* --- Schmitt triggers: rising Vir, falling Vir-Vhys ---
Bhq hq0 0 V=u(V(HI,VSS)-(Vir-Vhys*V(hq)))
Rhq hq0 hq 1k
Chq hq 0 0.1p
Blq lq0 0 V=u(V(LI,VSS)-(Vir-Vhys*V(lq)))
Rlq lq0 lq 1k
Clq lq 0 0.1p
* --- undervoltage lockouts ---
Buvd uvd0 0 V=u(V(VDD,VSS)-(Vuvdd-Vuvhys*V(uvd)))
Ruvd uvd0 uvd 1k
Cuvd uvd 0 1p
Buvh uvh0 0 V=u(V(HB,HS)-(Vuvhb-Vuvhys*V(uvh)))
Ruvh uvh0 uvh 1k
Cuvh uvh 0 1p
* --- propagation delays: turn-on tpdon, turn-off tpdoff (tpdon >= tpdoff) ---
* tmatch adds delay to the high-side channel only (HO-LO delay matching, 1.5 ns typ, 8 ns max)
Ehb hqb 0 hq 0 1
Thf hqb 0 hdf 0 Td={tpdoff+tmatch} Z0=1k
Rhf hdf 0 1k
Thn hqb 0 hdn 0 Td={tpdon+tmatch} Z0=1k
Rhn hdn 0 1k
Elb lqb 0 lq 0 1
Tlf lqb 0 ldf 0 Td={tpdoff} Z0=1k
Rlf ldf 0 1k
Tln lqb 0 ldn 0 Td={tpdon} Z0=1k
Rln ldn 0 1k
* --- output state 0..1, slewed (tslew ASSUMED; gives roughly the datasheet 1 nF rise time) ---
Bhs hs0 0 V=u(V(hdf)-0.5)*u(V(hdn)-0.5)*V(uvd)*V(uvh)
Rhs hs0 hst 1k
Chs hst 0 {tslew/1k}
Bls ls0 0 V=u(V(ldf)-0.5)*u(V(ldn)-0.5)*V(uvd)
Rls ls0 lst 1k
Cls lst 0 {tslew/1k}
* --- output stages: resistive near zero volts, saturating at the peak current ---
* Pull-up and pull-down cross-fade over tslew; Cout (ASSUMED) keeps the pins defined mid-transition.
Bhup HB HOH I=V(hst)*Isrc*tanh(V(HB,HOH)/(Rpu*Isrc))
Bhdn HOL HS I=(1-V(hst))*Isnk*tanh(V(HOL,HS)/(Rpd*Isnk))
Blup VDD LOH I=V(lst)*Isrc*tanh(V(VDD,LOH)/(Rpu*Isrc))
Bldn LOL VSS I=(1-V(lst))*Isnk*tanh(V(LOL,VSS)/(Rpd*Isnk))
Choh HOH HS {Cout}
Chol HOL HS {Cout}
Cloh LOH VSS {Cout}
Clol LOL VSS {Cout}
Rhoh HOH HS 1Meg
Rhol HOL HS 1Meg
Rloh LOH VSS 1Meg
Rlol LOL VSS 1Meg
* --- operating supply currents (datasheet 500 kHz values scaled to 400 kHz) ---
Idd VDD VSS {Iddo}
Ihb HB HS {Ihbo}
* --- internal bootstrap diode, cut off when HB-HS reaches the clamp level ---
* Fitted to VDL 0.45 V at 100 uA, VDH 0.90 V at 100 mA, RD 1.85 ohm. intdiode=0 removes it.
Dbs VDD nbs LM5113_DBS
Bbs nbs HB I=intdiode*V(nbs,HB)*20*max(min((Vclamp-V(HB,HS))/0.05,1),0)
Rbs nbs HB 100Meg
.model LM5113_DBS D(Is=6.2n N=1.77 Rs=1.39 Cjo=3p)
.ends LM5113_BEHAV
